---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact preview"><div class="interior"><h1>Tell us what is happening.</h1><p>This form demonstrates the design only. It does not submit, store, or send your information. Do not enter personal details into this preview.</p></div><section class="section split"><div><h2>Contact details</h2><p class="phone" data-business-phone>No phone configured</p><p>Sample data has no phone number. In a real-business preview, the public number is displayed as research information only. Call buttons are disabled to avoid accidental contact.</p><a data-business-source hidden href="#" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">View the official business source ↗</a><p class="sample-note">No appointment or service request is created here.</p></div><div class="card"><h2>Service request preview</h2><label class="field">Name<input disabled placeholder="Your name"/></label><label class="field">Phone<input disabled placeholder="Your phone"/></label><label class="field">What needs attention?<textarea disabled placeholder="Describe the problem" rows="4"></textarea></label><button class="button" disabled aria-disabled="true">Preview only. Not submitting.</button><p class="sample-note">The production form stays off until routing and receipt are tested.</p></div></section></Base>
